• Finally, you travel from Fisherman’s Wharf to Bayview (26 minutes), arriving by 14:03. Although you then wait a few hours until Jeffrey comes available at 17:30, you promptly meet him for his required 60 minutes (17:30–18:30), and his window (17:30–21:30) is easily accommodated.

